1
00:00:04,000 --> 00:00:10,920
SPEAKER_00: Alright, this is the review for last Thursday's pipeline outage. Omar, can you walk us through the timeline?

2
00:00:11,720 --> 00:00:17,880
SPEAKER_01: Sure. The nightly ingestion job failed at 2 a.m. because the upstream schema changed without notice.

3
00:00:18,680 --> 00:00:24,830
SPEAKER_01: Alerts fired, but they went to an old pager rotation, so nobody saw them until 7.

4
00:00:25,630 --> 00:00:29,860
SPEAKER_00: So two separate problems. The schema change and the alert routing.

5
00:00:30,660 --> 00:00:35,280
SPEAKER_01: Right. The routing one is easy. I'll fix the pager rotation today.

6
00:00:36,080 --> 00:00:45,690
SPEAKER_02: On the schema side, we don't have any contract with the upstream team. They can rename a column and we find out when things break.

7
00:00:46,490 --> 00:00:49,180
SPEAKER_00: Is there something lightweight we could do?

8
00:00:49,980 --> 00:00:57,290
SPEAKER_02: We could add schema checks at ingestion that fail loudly before loading. I can draft a proposal for that.

9
00:00:58,090 --> 00:01:01,940
SPEAKER_00: Please do. Can you get it to me by Friday?

10
00:01:02,740 --> 00:01:04,740
SPEAKER_02: Yes, Friday works.

11
00:01:05,540 --> 00:01:15,150
SPEAKER_03: The bigger issue for my team is that the dashboards showed stale numbers all morning and nobody flagged it. Finance pulled a report off them.

12
00:01:15,950 --> 00:01:22,110
SPEAKER_00: That's bad. Tomás, could you reach out to finance and make sure they re-run that report?

13
00:01:22,910 --> 00:01:25,980
SPEAKER_03: Yeah, I'll reach out to them this afternoon.

14
00:01:26,780 --> 00:01:33,320
SPEAKER_01: We should also add a freshness banner to the dashboards when data is older than a day.

15
00:01:34,120 --> 00:01:37,970
SPEAKER_00: Agreed, let's do that. Freshness banners on all tier-one dashboards.

16
00:01:38,770 --> 00:01:43,380
SPEAKER_03: I can look into how hard that is in our BI tool.

17
00:01:44,180 --> 00:01:54,570
SPEAKER_00: Also, going forward, any upstream schema change needs a heads-up in the data-platform channel at least 48 hours ahead. I'll take that to the upstream team's lead.

18
00:01:55,370 --> 00:02:04,220
SPEAKER_01: One more risk. The backfill for Thursday's data hasn't run yet. If it doesn't finish before month-end close, finance numbers will be off.

19
00:02:05,020 --> 00:02:09,630
SPEAKER_02: I'll kick off the backfill tonight and keep an eye on it.

20
00:02:10,430 --> 00:02:16,200
SPEAKER_00: Great. Let's do a follow-up next Tuesday to check on all of this. Thanks all.
